                     <br/>active ingredient*</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">children's<br/>loratadine<br/>syrup</content>
                     <br/>(loratadine oral solution)<br/>5 mg/5 mL antihistamine</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>indoor &amp; outdoor allergies<br/>original prescription strength</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>24 hour non-drowsy<sup>†</sup> relief of:<br/>sneezing; runny nose;<br/>itchy, watery eyes; itchy throat or nose</paragraph>
